---
// /credits/ (prompt 33 §1.4): the photographs that ask for a credit, in the three languages, linked from the footer.
import "../styles/v2.css";
import { CREDITS } from "../lib/credits";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Créditos · Credits · Crédits · Imóveis Portugal</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="hd"><div class="frame"><a class="word" href="/">Imóveis Portugal</a></div></header>
    <main class="frame read" style="padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:96px">
      <h1>Créditos das fotografias</h1>
      <p class="lede"><span lang="en">Photo credits</span> · <span lang="fr">Crédits photo</span></p>
      <ul>{CREDITS.map((x) => <li>{x.place}: <a href={x.url} rel="noopener">{x.title}</a>, {x.author}, <a href={x.licenceUrl} rel="license noopener">{x.licence}</a>.</li>)}</ul>
      <p>As restantes fotografias e vídeos vêm do Pixabay e do Mixkit, com licenças que não pedem crédito.</p>
      <p lang="en">The other photographs and videos come from Pixabay and Mixkit, under licences that ask for no credit.</p>
      <p lang="fr">Les autres photos et vidéos viennent de Pixabay et de Mixkit, sous des licences qui ne demandent pas de crédit.</p>
      <h2>Mapa · <span lang="en">Map</span> · <span lang="fr">Carte</span></h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Preços e rendas por m²: <a href="https://www.ine.pt/" rel="noopener">INE, Instituto Nacional de Estatística</a>. Taxa de juro: <a href="https://www.bportugal.pt/" rel="noopener">Banco de Portugal</a>.</li>
        <li>Limites dos concelhos e freguesias, campos de golfe e praias: © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>, <a href="https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/" rel="license noopener">ODbL</a>.</li>
        <li>Relevo: <a href="https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/" rel="noopener">Terrain Tiles</a> (Mapzen, AWS Open Data). EU-DEM: produced using Copernicus data and information funded by the European Union, EU-DEM layers. SRTM and GMTED2010: courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey. ETOPO1: Amante, C. and B. W. Eakins, NOAA National Geophysical Data Center.</li>
        <li>Rios: <a href="https://www.naturalearthdata.com/" rel="noopener">Natural Earth</a>; domínio público.</li>
        <li>Mapa: <a href="https://maplibre.org/" rel="noopener">MapLibre GL JS</a>, BSD-3-Clause.</li>
      </ul>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
